Task description


#Item Editor
dialog to edit catalago data, maybe displays  a dt table of one catalago, there is a button to switch to another catalago
and in the table should display the catalago item and the count being used, a row can be clicked to select  and options appear
delete,edit,
edit:
    allows to change name
        if the name does not exist, prompts for it and warns what will happen

    if new name exists:
        it warns that it will update the name of  the  item 

delete:
    it warns that it will the delete the item, and all fabrics that use the item will remove that item from it

the first time the program runs, it checks if the table that stores the count is empty, if so, ruuns a  function that gathers 
the counts  for each catalago item

the table holds 
catalago_table_name
item_name
count
